# Anoint with Affliction: "Exile that creature instead if its controller has three or more poison counters." Bot1's
# Glistener Elf gives Bot2 three poison counters (turns 3, 5, 7). On turn 7 Bot1 steals Bot2's Argothian Elder (mana
# value 4) with Act of Treason: Bot2 owns it and has three poison counters, but Bot1 controls it and has none. The
# controller counts, so Anoint does nothing (CR 608.2h, 110.2: the owner would exile it).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Glistener Elf
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Act of Treason
Anoint with Affliction
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Argothian Elder
Island x15

